WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.000
Running a vacation rental means juggling five different tools

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.700
just to keep your calendar straight.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.600
Hostastic brings it all into one place,

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.600
built for hosts who'd rather grow than manage.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.400
Sync every booking channel —

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.000
Airbnb, Booking.com, Vrbo — automatically.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.800
No double bookings, no manual updates.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.800
Give guests a way to book directly,

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.200
on your own branded website —

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.200
no commission, no middleman.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.600
Let AI handle the repetitive guest messages —

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.200
check-in details, FAQs, even multiple languages —

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.000
while you focus on the hospitality

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.400
that actually matters.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.200
And see exactly how you're doing with built-in reporting —

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:58.200
invoices, occupancy, guest and channel breakdowns —

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.400
free for every Hostastic user.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:07.600
One platform. Every booking channel.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.000
Happier guests, less busywork —

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.400
that's Hostastic.
